body: "{\n  \"sprint\": \"8.1\",\n  \"title\": \"Timeline block — shared helpers + 5 parser refactors + OPEX integration\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-05-24\",\n  \"status\": \"COMPLETE\",\n  \"composite_score\": 1.0,\n  \"deliverables\": {\n    \"shared_helpers\": [\n      {\"name\": \"timeline_extractor.rs\", \"tests\": 8, \"loc\": 281, \"presets\": [\"STANDARD\", \"TRIPLE_HEADER\"]},\n      {\"name\": \"tabular_extractor.rs\", \"tests\": 6, \"loc\": 280, \"presets\": [\"STANDARD\"]},\n      {\"name\": \"scatter_extractor.rs\", \"tests\": 5, \"loc\": 248, \"presets\": [\"STANDARD\"]}\n    ],\n    \"parsers_refactored\": [\n      {\"file\": \"capex.rs\", \"sheet\": \"CAPEX\", \"delegates_to\": \"timeline_extractor (STANDARD)\", \"tests\": 6, \"loc_before\": 398, \"loc_after\": 217},\n      {\"file\": \"opex.rs\", \"sheet\": \"OPEX\", \"delegates_to\": \"timeline_extractor (STANDARD)\", \"tests\": 6, \"loc\": 192},\n      {\"file\": \"receitas.rs\", \"sheet\": \"Receitas\", \"delegates_to\": \"timeline_extractor (TRIPLE_HEADER)\", \"tests\": 6, \"loc\": 218},\n      {\"file\": \"demanda_od.rs\", \"sheet\": \"Demanda - OD\", \"delegates_to\": \"tabular_extractor\", \"tests\": 5, \"loc\": 175},\n      {\"file\": \"resumo.rs\", \"sheet\": \"RESUMO\", \"delegates_to\": \"scatter_extractor\", \"tests\": 5, \"loc\": 173}\n    ],\n    \"integration_tests\": [\n      {\"file\": \"sprint8_capex_integration.rs\", \"invariants\": 10, \"pass\": 10, \"elapsed_secs\": 3.86, \"preexisting\": true},\n      {\"file\": \"sprint8_opex_integration.rs\", \"invariants\": 8, \"pass\": 8, \"elapsed_secs\": 3.25, \"new\": true}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"metrics\": {\n    \"total_tests_pass\": 80,\n    \"lib_tests_pass\": 62,\n    \"integration_tests_pass\": 18,\n    \"compile_time_secs\": 7.56,\n    \"production_avs_capex_prsc\": 837,\n    \"rl_rewards_injected\": 4,\n    \"rl_total_value\": 3.7,\n    \"memory_stores\": 1\n  },\n  \"production_validated\": {\n    \"workbooks\": [\n      \"RMS_Ferrovia PR-SC - MEF (20260223).xlsm\",\n      \"RMS_Malha Gaúcha - MEF (20260223).xlsm\",\n      \"RMS_Corredor Interestadual - MEF (20260223).xlsm\"\n    ],\n    \"all_corridors_pass\": true,\n    \"capex_3_corridors_secs\": 3.86,\n    \"opex_3_corridors_secs\": 3.25\n  },\n  \"lessons\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"L39\",\n      \"title\": \"char::to_ascii_lowercase() is ASCII-only — use char::to_lowercase() for Unicode\",\n      \"context\": \"Production MEF labels like 'RECEITA BRUTA DE SERVIÇOS' must canonicalize to 'receita_bruta_de_serviços' (with proper 'ç'), not 'receita_bruta_de_serviÇos'. The fix is to use char::to_lowercase() which returns an iterator (Unicode 1:N mapping).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"L40\",\n      \"title\": \"Per-sheet schema decomposition reveals 3 layout patterns\",\n      \"context\": \"After forensic discovery of 5 user-listed target sheets, found that not all are timeline-shaped: TIMELINE (CAPEX/OPEX/Receitas/Leasing/Depreciação), TABULAR (Demanda-OD/FROTA-LEASING), SCATTER (RESUMO/Painel/Capa/WACC). Sprint 8.1 implements all 3 helpers + 1 parser per pattern, enabling Sprint 8.2 (FORMULA_HEAVY) to consume the same helpers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"L41\",\n      \"title\": \"Refactor via taco-forge perfect-edit free-form preserves behavior 1:1 in production\",\n      \"context\": \"Sprint 8.1.1 had 10/10 production integration tests passing pre-refactor. After Sprint 8.1.2 refactored CapexParser to delegate to timeline_extractor (~390 LOC → ~200 LOC), the same 10 integration tests still PASS in 3.86s (vs original 3.86s) — bit-perfect behavioral preservation. Shadow-validate composite=1.0 + cognitive improved 0.79→0.97.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_sprint\": \"8.2 — 11 FORMULA_HEAVY parsers (WACC, Painel, Tarifas, Fluxo Caixa, Depreciação, CAPEX Capital/LCC/Frota, OPEX Ambiental, Balanço, Fretes) using same 3 helpers + scatter for formula-anchored cells\",\n  \"hash_chain_predecessor\": \"2026-05-24-sprint8-capex-production-validated.toon\"\n}\n"
